          <el-form-item label="SOFA年龄核实依据"><el-input v-model="ageBasis" aria-label="SOFA年龄核实依据" type="textarea" maxlength="1000" /></el-form-item>
          <el-form-item label="SOFA原护理场景"><el-select v-model="careSetting" aria-label="SOFA原护理场景" placeholder="请明确选择"><el-option label="ICU" value="icu" /><el-option label="其他临床场景" value="other" /><el-option label="原场景未知" value="unknown" /></el-select></el-form-item>
          <el-form-item label="SOFA原场景依据"><el-input v-model="careBasis" aria-label="SOFA原场景依据" type="textarea" maxlength="1000" /></el-form-item>
          <el-form-item label="SOFA本版适用性已核实"><el-select v-model="applicability" aria-label="SOFA本版适用性已核实" placeholder="明确核实，不能由管理身份代替"><el-option label="明确确认（true）" :value="true" /><el-option label="明确未确认（false）" :value="false" /></el-select></el-form-item>
          <p>已完成逐源判读 {{ reviewedCount }}/{{ candidate.manifest.members.length }}。没有判读的源不会因为翻页而自动确认或排除。</p>
